                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A technical drawing or plan to scale which serves as a guide for the construction or manufacture of something such as a building or machine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "849db25b-4ead-4624-a0ee-e17b303f875c",
                                                "sense_id": "7e139d20-f6dd-322b-a2cf-454c0b8abad5",
                                                "text": "But in neither case had the preparations proceeded beyond contemplation; no working drawings of any kind been prepared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0c54233-3bc7-445d-a15d-913860ddfff2",
                                                "sense_id": "7e139d20-f6dd-322b-a2cf-454c0b8abad5",
                                                "text": "Authority to construct eight carriages, to test the new design in public service, had already been given; but of course complete working drawings had first to be prepared."
